# L2-DEC-017 rounding parity, case 1 of 2. The records of
# standard-timestamps.hex with counter values 0x00000000 then 0x00000001.
# At --standard-tick-rate-hz 2000000.0000000002 one tick is
# 0.49999999999999994 us, one ULP below 0.5: round() gives 0, so DELTA is
# 0.000000. floor(x + 0.5) -- the C++ form before this case -- gave 1 us.

